  loreId: lore_l3_cooling
  title: "Jurnal tehnician: r\u0103cire"
  body: "Unitatea CRAC-2 cade iar. Peste 40 de grade, dronele trec singure \xEEn
    patrulare agresiv\u0103. Nu te pune \xEEntre ele \u0219i rafturi, nu discuta
    cu ele \u0219i, mai ales, nu le ar\u0103ta ecusonul: \xEEl scaneaz\u0103."
  titleEn: 'Technician log: cooling'
  bodyEn: 'CRAC-2 is down again. Above 40 degrees the drones switch to aggressive
    patrol on their own. Don''t get between them and the racks, don''t argue with
    them and, above all, don''t show them your badge: they scan it.'
  levelId: level03
  order: 6
